Package: lightson
Title: Download and Analyse Nighttime Lights Satellite Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Saket", "Choudhary",
           email = "saketc@iitb.ac.in",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-5202-7633"))
Description: Downloads and processes nighttime lights (NTL) satellite data
    from NASA VIIRS/Black Marble (VNP46A4 annual composites) and India's 
    ISRO Bhuvan NTL portal.
